00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mmhm.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Whitney Hodges: The senior staff doesn't really have…

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Whitney Hodges: much search volume at all, though, right?

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, very low search volume. It's also a small area, so it's like, I can only do so much, so yeah.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:08.000
