00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, it's not spending, it's only gotten 16 impressions, and I had to really, like, broaden, like, anyone searching anything senior, but, you know, so yeah.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Whitney Hodges: You know.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. Yeah, I wonder if, like, seasonally it would be different, you know?

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, I'm like, is it the season right now to start inquiring for that? Because I think senior photos are in the beginning of senior year, so I don't know if summer is for that, I don't know, but that's a good question for Bree, so.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.000
Whitney Hodges: Right. Yeah.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. Yeah. So, I mean, if it's not really spending, I guess it doesn't really hurt anything for her to just kind of, like.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:44.000
Whitney Hodges: keep it on for now. Um, what she is really wanting to move.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mmhm.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:57.000
Whitney Hodges: towards is us no longer doing full-service ads management. So, I think my question for her is, like, is she ready to make that transition now, or…

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.000
Whitney Hodges: Are we waiting? Hey, how are you?

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hey, Brie.

