Bri Garofalo: Hello! How are you guys?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.000
Whitney Hodges: Good! Good to see you!

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: How are you?

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Bri Garofalo: Good to see you.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:09.000
Whitney Hodges: How's your summer season going so far? Are you crazy busy?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:15.000
