Whitney Hodges: consultative basis. So, just wanted to kind of, like, gauge that with you again, like, if you're feeling like the timing is right for that now, or if you want to give it, like, another month or so. Um, how are you… how are you feeling on your end?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.000
Bri Garofalo: Mm-hmm.

