Bri Garofalo: Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:49.000
Whitney Hodges: available to get on a call with you to just kind of, like, look at everything together, um, on an ongoing basis. That's definitely something we could do from there.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.000
Bri Garofalo: Mm-hmm.

